				1578,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Format arrays in tauri.conf.json\n\nReformat `externalBin` and `targets` arrays in tauri.conf.json from single-line to multi-line for consistency with the rest of the configuration file. Also strip the trailing newline to match convention.\n\nNo functional changes — purely cosmetic formatting.",
			"SHA": "4b54b6c25ffbf182ea9e813b5027759384979cf7"
		},
